1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
This command is safe when Earth sends it. Fourteen minutes later, the battery has fallen from 85% to 28%. Force it and the spacecraft crosses its reserve. Reject it and the mission loses the data. EchoLock finds—and proves—the third option.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:38,000
EchoLock is an intent escrow for delayed space commands. It seals the untouched original command with its goal, assumptions, hard invariants, and authorised adaptations.

3
00:00:38,000 --> 00:01:04,000
At arrival, EchoLock verifies both seals and rechecks the command against current state. A safe command executes. When conditions drift, it attaches a separate Intent-Safe Patch. The original is never rewritten.

4
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:24,000
If a safe opportunity exists before expiry, EchoLock defers. If integrity fails, the command expires, or no safe authorised option remains, it rejects. The precedence is deterministic and fail-closed.

5
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:55,000
The Counterfactual Predictor compares three futures. Forcing the original violates the battery floor. Rejecting everything returns no science. The verified adaptation preserves science while every invariant passes. These are deterministic toy-model outcomes, not flight predictions.

6
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Every decision produces a Delta Certificate. Its SHA-256 hash binds the command, intent, arrival state, patch, verdict, checks, and counterfactual evidence. The semantic replay hash proves equivalent runs agree, and every audit entry links backward.

7
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Across 60 fixed, balanced synthetic cases—15 per verdict—the pipeline verified 60 certificate hashes and 60 replay hashes with zero safety violations in this constructed benchmark. These numbers do not claim operational accuracy.

8
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:52,000
IBM Bob was the principal AI development partner for the initial architecture and core Phase 0 and 1 safety pipeline. Codex independently audited, corrected, and continued later phases. The repository records that provenance exactly.

9
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:58,000
EchoLock: preserve the intent, adapt the action, and prove the difference.
